quest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116693","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116693.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116693.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:12Z"},"body":"- Alternative to #116690\r\n\r\nThis is an idea I had entirely on a whim and everything seems to be functioning? So I'm just rolling with it and putting up this PR to see what happens\r\n\r\nThis PR leverages `#include_next` for clang/gcc and relative-path shenanigans for msvc, in order to allow a `windows.h` file added to `platforms/windows/` to function as the \"real\" `windows.h` for *the entire repository*. This means that those includes, even for thirdparties, will always have the dumb windows macros disabled & guarantees the lean-and-mean implementation\r\n\r\nFrankly, I'm shocked this is working at all, let alone so well. It feels like cheating.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116693/react